<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant Islamist groups in Cabo Delgado have killed a woman and displaced over 1,200 civilians as attacks continue against locals. A blogger exposing chromium pollution was killed while livestreaming, and a recent hostage situation ended with militants freeing captured fishermen. Qatar and Mozambique held political consultations, and Russia noted updated bilateral relations with Mozambique. The insurgency caused 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168729&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFBGV2lMWFI3dkxPVUQ1MXR6R3Q2LVg4VjZib1RBNWUyZ2RnZjNabmRIODdjOE4xVXZJSlNBTzZXYUpPay10VGt2UDZtUkhMT1E5eHMyNFo5c0dUZ29h?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQY0tXYmdvcXFQR21xNXdEbFRUSEdDVWVuRlpUZWxCNjl1Q3dVZU1LSkNOUC1YVFJPZENKMVBfaUFXbVUzQVJTWjduRUw5dE1IX1VMdTZzdlQtN3dBcC01Z2RoTUR0WEJ1RDZBdDZTc2x1aThSRDdqZ0tjNkdNUGM1U251a3BxdFg5VExR?oc=5&quot;&gt;aimnews.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNVjBRVnNRY0VlVzJKS1dCZ2tuanZGdXNNaWZJX29qUzVFdFYxQkFoTVNyeDNFOHZGb2ZmZWxBM1VHY2JiMm13bzE4TkxuMTk1ZW5wbFVKZFQtMWV4R0ozd0VIMlhqNTI0Smw5Tjk3TmhVeEpHVkRsSkgyNExvZXVvZHRCeWdBQmxseHRFWTFvajRoRmpzYXg2TXNZYXNlZ3Q4dk5VbktuUFUySWM?oc=5&quot;&gt;People Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxOU2tiTVAxZ25taUJsUml6ZVJwTXgtbkNoZzJtaEhGdDFGR1NMMEFqeFh2Z0xBRzgxTDdBWlRsTXQxcVlvUFFHRi03a1loRXhCLVlwbUswUHlwVV9MVUI4SmNib0FGZWlKMGpBQUhmOXRuZE9Xb08yX01UR2FjTnZaZkdBQmJLcHN1eDdrcEpzMjhLNU0?oc=5&quot;&gt;russia's pivot to asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;htt